    workspace::tests::sys_a_build_from_one_checkout_works_on_the_checkout_it_runs_in

[break] root-outside-every-checkout-falls-back
rule: Outside every checkout xtask refuses, and asks for `--root`, rather than work on the checkout it was built in.
file: xtask/src/main.rs
